<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your account is currently at risk for charge off this month due to either 90 days of non-payment or excessive delinquency.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">In an effort to prevent the charge off this month, your account will need to be set up on a formal modification.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">To apply for the modification, please respond with:</span></p><ul type="disc" style=""><li class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Bank Statements for&nbsp;<span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!Case.Last_Month__c}</span></font></p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: normal;"><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">Month to date transaction history for</font><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;">&nbsp;<font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Current_Month__c}</font></span></p></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">What payments you can maintain daily/weekly/monthly</font></p></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">When do you anticipate being able to resume in full?</span></p></li>
</ul><div><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Once received, the credit manager and legal team will review and issue a Modification Agreement for signature.</span></div><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: normal;"><br></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>